Aeolus notes

sudo apt install aeolus

to make stop modifiable make stops writable

sudo chmod 777 -R /usr/share/aeolus/stops (maybe this should have a few fewer permissions?)


UI issues galore. Testing text mode. To enable a stop use this: s P + prin8


